# Kalshi Arbitrage Engine — Environment Configuration
#
# The engine connects strictly to Kalshi's public, unauthenticated read-only REST endpoints
# (https://api.elections.kalshi.com/trade-api/v2) for market data observation and paper trading.
# No API keys, credentials, or write tokens are required for documented functionality.
#
# Optional system settings:
# SSL_CERT_FILE=/path/to/custom/cacert.pem
